# 🧩 MITRE ATT&CK Connection

Suppose you observe:

```text
PowerShell
```

That behavior can be mapped to an ATT&CK technique related to **Command and Scripting Interpreter: PowerShell**.

This gives analysts a standardized language for describing attacker behavior.

